<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/17/eng@/~cl_54> <https://schema.org/text> "Chapter 2 of Part XI of the principal Act is amended in the heading by deleting the words “of appointed officers”. Substitution of section 215"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/17/eng@/~cl_55> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/17/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/17/eng@> .
