<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/17/eng@/~cl_83> <https://schema.org/text> "Any policies or plans including the National Land Public Transport Masterplan made by the Commission, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, is revoked."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/17/eng@> .
