<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/17/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Paragraph 12 g(1)(b) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “by any Government Entity” the words “under any written law”. Amendment of section 13"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/17/eng@> .
